      <is>
        A visibility-narrowing diagnostic
      </is>
      <summary>
        Emitted when an override reduces visibility (e.g. public → protected, or protected → private).
      </summary>
      <documentation>
        Override matching uses normalizedLogicalName. Widening (protected → public) is allowed; narrowing is forbidden. Private members cannot be overridden at all.
      </documentation>
      <keywords>
        <blockml:meta.FreeTextKeyword term="BML_VISIBILITY_NARROWING" />
      </keywords>
      <references>
        <see type="blockml:documentation.MemberVisibility" relation="AuthoringGuide">
          Visibility on override — widen only.
        </see>
        <see type="blockml:documentation.PartialMemberOverrides" relation="SeeAlso">
          Override merge and visibility.
        </see>
        <see type="blockml:task.FixVisibilityAccess" relation="Resolves">
          Widen or keep visibility on override.
        </see>
      </references>
    </block>
